# The two new resource failures and their texts.
# ChangeLog 10.30 items 2 and 22; pcre2api.3, "The match context".

# Depth: "matching depth limit exceeded", reached from the subject modifier,
# from its obsolete synonym, and from the in-pattern verb.
/(z+)+Q/no_auto_possess,no_start_optimize
    zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz\=depth_limit=4
Failed: error -53: matching depth limit exceeded
    zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz\=recursion_limit=4
Failed: error -53: matching depth limit exceeded
    zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz\=match_limit=10
Failed: error -47: match limit exceeded

/(*LIMIT_DEPTH=4)(z+)+Q/no_auto_possess,no_start_optimize
    zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz
Failed: error -53: matching depth limit exceeded

/(*LIMIT_RECURSION=4)(z+)+Q/no_auto_possess,no_start_optimize
    zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz
Failed: error -53: matching depth limit exceeded

# Heap: "heap limit exceeded" once the frame vector has to leave the stack.
/^(z)*Q/no_auto_possess,no_start_optimize
    \[z]{2000}\=heap_limit=0
Failed: error -63: heap limit exceeded
    \[z]{2000}\=heap_limit=1
Failed: error -63: heap limit exceeded

/(*LIMIT_HEAP=0)^(z)*Q/no_auto_possess,no_start_optimize
    \[z]{2000}
Failed: error -63: heap limit exceeded
